Completed the 1st season.
- choices matter to some extent(also the main ones are shown in the main menu);
- puzzles have logic;
- story looks interesting so far;
- protagonist's ability to reverse time (reminds of Prince of Persia: The Two Thrones);
- collectibles are interesting to search for and it goes along with the story;
- good graphics (style);
- music;
- VA.
- atmosphere, which is  meant to be "high school", breaks at some point;
- PhysX might cause the game to crush, the way around described on the forum.

